ssion: none, but we can say \"Given the initial overview...\" It's okay.\n\nProvide evidence: D concentrates well, solves problems extremely well, takes responsibility seriously (strengths). Concern: hot temper, know-it-all (cooperation). Compare to others: A's communication issues, B's nasty remarks, C's show-off and not open.\n\nThus vote D.\n\nNow produce output."}
